post.description:
Create a member (``members.add_global_member``; matches ``MemberAdmin``).

Collects the admin add form's required subset (name, gender, email, groups);
the remaining fields default per the model and are edited afterwards.

Filled SJR application PDF for an excursion (``sjr_application``).

``payload.bill_id`` selects the bill whose proof is embedded as the invoice;
the bill must belong to the excursion's statement and carry a proof.
